## 8. Recommended Title Options (Ranked)

**1. Why Your AI ROI Measurement Is Broken — And What to Track Instead**
Strongest. Directly confrontational, implies the reader is currently doing something wrong, promises a specific fix. Will make a CFO stop scrolling.

**2. The 70-80% of AI Value Your Board Is Ignoring**
Provocative statistic-led. Works well for LinkedIn distribution and AI overview citation. Slightly weaker because it depends on the 70-80% figure being sourced — if that gap isn't resolved, the title is a liability.

**3. Enterprise AI ROI: Why the First 9 Months Don't Look Like Success**
More empathetic, less confrontational. Speaks directly to the CFO-frustration scenario. Lower click-through potential but higher fit for an audience already in the "AI program is struggling" moment.

